| **Category**    | **Property**      | **Example**                       | **What it Does**          |
| --------------- | ----------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------- |
| **Font & Text** | `font-family`     | `font-family: Arial, sans-serif;` | Sets the font             |
|                 | `font-size`       | `font-size: 18px;`                | Sets text size            |
|                 | `font-weight`     | `font-weight: bold;`              | Boldness (100–900)        |
|                 | `font-style`      | `font-style: italic;`             | Italic or normal          |
|                 | `line-height`     | `line-height: 1.5;`               | Spacing between lines     |
|                 | `text-align`      | `text-align: center;`             | Aligns text               |
|                 | `text-decoration` | `text-decoration: underline;`     | Underline, overline, none |
|                 | `text-transform`  | `text-transform: uppercase;`      | Upper/lower/capitalize    |
|                 | `letter-spacing`  | `letter-spacing: 2px;`            | Space between letters     |
|                 | `word-spacing`    | `word-spacing: 5px;`              | Space between words       |
|                 | `text-shadow`     | `text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px gray;`  | Shadow effect             |
| **Background**    | **Property**            | **Example**                        | **What it Does**      |
| ----------------- | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------- | --------------------- |
| **Color & Image** | `background-color`      | `background-color: lightblue;`     | Sets background color |
|                   | `background-image`      | `background-image: url('bg.jpg');` | Sets image            |
|                   | `background-repeat`     | `background-repeat: no-repeat;`    | Repeat or not         |
|                   | `background-size`       | `background-size: cover;`          | Fit/cover/contain     |
|                   | `background-position`   | `background-position: center;`     | Positioning           |
|                   | `background-attachment` | `background-attachment: fixed;`    | Scrolls or fixed      |
| **Box Model** | **Property**    | **Example**                     | **What it Does**                |
| ------------- | --------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| **Spacing**   | `margin`        | `margin: 20px;`                 | Space outside element           |
|               | `padding`       | `padding: 15px;`                | Space inside element            |
|               | `border`        | `border: 2px solid black;`      | Border style                    |
|               | `border-radius` | `border-radius: 10px;`          | Rounded corners                 |
|               | `box-shadow`    | `box-shadow: 3px 3px 5px gray;` | Shadow around element           |
| **Size**      | `width`         | `width: 300px;`                 | Width of element                |
|               | `height`        | `height: 150px;`                | Height of element               |
| **Display**   | `display`       | `display: block;`               | Block, inline, flex, grid, none |
|               | `visibility`    | `visibility: hidden;`           | Hide but keep space             |
| **Table** | **Property**      | **Example**                  | **What it Does**    |
| --------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------- |
|           | `border-collapse` | `border-collapse: collapse;` | Merge borders       |
|           | `border-spacing`  | `border-spacing: 10px;`      | Space between cells |
|           | `caption-side`    | `caption-side: bottom;`      | Caption position    |
| **Positioning & Layout** | **Property**               | **Example**                       | **What it Does**                          |
| ------------------------ | -------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| **Positioning**          | `position`                 | `position: absolute;`             | Static, relative, absolute, fixed, sticky |
|                          | `top, right, bottom, left` | `top: 10px;`                      | Offsets element                           |
|                          | `z-index`                  | `z-index: 10;`                    | Stack order                               |
| **Floating**             | `float`                    | `float: left;`                    | Floats element                            |
|                          | `clear`                    | `clear: both;`                    | Prevents float overlap                    |
| **Flexbox**              | `display: flex;`           | `display: flex;`                  | Enables flex layout                       |
|                          | `justify-content`          | `justify-content: center;`        | Aligns items horizontally                 |
|                          | `align-items`              | `align-items: center;`            | Aligns items vertically                   |
|                          | `flex-wrap`                | `flex-wrap: wrap;`                | Wraps items                               |
| **Grid**                 | `display: grid;`           | `display: grid;`                  | Enables grid layout                       |
|                          | `grid-template-columns`    | `grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;` | Defines columns                           |
|                          | `grid-gap`                 | `grid-gap: 10px;`                 | Gap between cells                         |
